        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin SAN-CQE, Santa Cruz Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Santa Cruz Handleset with Square Escutcheon features a very modern design, with the sharp lines that define that design aesthetic. The Santa Cruz Handleset has three contemporary interior trim levers and knobs. As part of Baldwin's Reserve Collection, the Santa Cruz Entryset has a lifetime mechanical warranty and a 25 year finish warranty. Choose from single cylinder emergency egress and dummy functions. This handleset comes with an adjustable latch that will fit 2-3/4 inch backsets and 2-3/8 inch backsets. It will fit 1-3/4 inch up to 2-1/2 inch thick doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Santa Cruz Handleset with Contemporary Square Escutcheon Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits 2-1/8\" cross bore for both deadbolt and grip with a 1\" edge bore for both grip latch and deadbolt latch.</li>\r\n<li>Baldwin C-Keyway.</li>\r\n<li>Latch: square corner adjustable</li>\r\n<li>Strike: square corner</li>\r\n<li>Brass deadbolt features 1\" throw. Grip offers 1/2\" passage/privacy function bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 25 year finish warranty and a limited lifetime mechanical warranty.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Baldwin Reserve Modern Santa Cruz Entrance Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Length: 17-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Width: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 2-13/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2\" standard with optional thick door kit for 2\" - 2-1/2\".</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
