                "title": "Santa Cruz Handleset with Contemporary Escutcheon",
                "description": "The Santa Cruz Handleset with Square Escutcheon features a very modern design, with the sharp lines that define that design aesthetic. The Santa Cruz Handleset has three contemporary interior trim levers and knobs. As part of Baldwin's Reserve Collection, the Santa Cruz Entryset has a lifetime mechanical warranty and a 25 year finish warranty. Choose from single cylinder emergency egress and dummy functions. This handleset comes with an adjustable latch that will fit 2-3/4 inch backsets and 2-3/8 inch backsets. It will fit 1-3/4 inch up to 2-1/2 inch thick doors.",
